#: ../../language/error_codes/E4083.md:1
msgid "E4083"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4083.md:3
msgid ""
"The default value in a `with` pattern cannot refer to a binder introduced"
" by the complete pattern. The default expression is evaluated in the "
"surrounding scope, where that binder is not available."
msgstr ""
"`with` 模式中的默认值不能引用完整模式引入的绑定变量。默认表达式在外围作用域中求值，而该绑定变量"
"在那里不可用。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4083.md:7
msgid "Erroneous example"
msgstr "错误示例"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4083.md:9
msgid ""
"///|\n"
"pub fn value_or(value : Int?, result : Int) -> Int {\n"
"  match value {\n"
"    Some(result) | (None with result = result) => result\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4083.md:13
msgid "Suggestion"
msgstr "修改建议"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4083.md:15
msgid "Use a value that is available in the surrounding scope."
msgstr "请使用外围作用域中可用的值。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4083.md:17
msgid ""
"///|\n"
"pub fn value_or(value : Int?, fallback : Int) -> Int {\n"
"  match value {\n"
"    Some(result) | (None with result = fallback) => result\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
